### 查找个人信息（把1替换成实际personId）
GET http://localhost:22222/api/person/1

### 学生端-添加荣誉申请（name/level/awardDate/description是正确字段名）
POST http://localhost:22222/api/honor/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": {"id": 1},
  "name": "国家奖学金",
  "level": "国家级",
  "awardDate": "2024-06-01",
  "description": "学业成绩优秀",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 学生端-提交出入申请（startTime/endTime/reason是正确字段名）
POST http://localhost:22222/api/access/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student": {"id": 1},
  "startTime": "2024-06-10T08:00:00",
  "endTime": "2024-06-15T18:00:00",
  "reason": "回家探亲",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 更新个人信息（Person只有name/gender/phone/email/address/birthday）
PUT http://localhost:22222/api/person/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "张三",
  "gender": "男",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "address": "山东省济南市",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01"
}

### 学生端-获取我的荣誉列表（把1替换成实际studentId）
GET http://localhost:22222/api/honor/my-list
Content-Type: application/json

1


